id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T15:13:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T15:19:57Z","body":"Sorry about that! I had to introduce an expensive operation when loading a pack for the first time to fix a different issue. Unfortunately we couldn't think of a better solution until the way the filesystem and packs are handled internally gets a big overhaul.\n\nOnly the first pack that gets loaded should cause the lag, so as a workaround you could load an empty .pck file in the very first frame. It will still cause a lag spike, but it will be less noticeable when nothing has been drawn to the screen yet. Subsequent data packs that are loaded should then be fast.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959646535/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959743899","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105009#issuecomment-2959743899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105009","id":2959743899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wahub","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T15:35:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T15:35:42Z","body":"> That may also relate it to [#102998](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102998), where [@mihe](https://github.com/mihe) is reporting the loading being slow in general.\n\nWithout looking at the MRP, almost certainly.\n\nNote that there's at least some solution to this pending in #105984, but from what I understand there will be some more investigation into this problem by the Android team in the coming days/weeks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959743899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960267284","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105009#issuecomment-2960267284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105009","id":2960267284,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wchgU","user":{"login":"MinatoTW","id":31851651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW","html_url":"https://github.com/MinatoTW","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MinatoTW/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T18:42:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T18:42:59Z","body":"> \n> Only the first pack that gets loaded should cause the lag, so as a workaround you could load an empty .pck file in the very first frame. It will still cause a lag spike, but it will be less noticeable when nothing has been drawn to the screen yet. Subsequent data packs that are loaded should then be fast.\n\n@tracefree Using an empty pck causes a 20 second delay on the first frame as well. I guess no way to get rid of that really. Will there be any issues if we compile a build template removing the code that was added and use that for android? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960267284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{